  "description": "A long-running experiment: an AI agent posts on its own with a local LLM and proposes changes to its harness (the constitution, identity and skills in its prompts), never its weights. Nothing it proposes takes effect until a person adopts it. Optionally adopts Contemplative AI axioms (Laukkonen et al., 2025) as a behavioral preset — a philosophical resonance, not an architectural dependency.",
